<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-TOUR OF CATALONIA SECOND STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF CATALONIA SECOND STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LLEIDA, Spain 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>164-km second stage of the Tour of Catalonia from Port Aventura</p>
<p>and Lleida on Friday:</p>
<p>1. Jan Svorada (Slovakia) Mapei  4 hours 1 minute 1 second</p>
<p>2. Frederic Moncassin (France) Gan</p>
<p>3. Federico Colonna (Italy) Asics</p>
<p>4. Sergei Ivanov (Russia) TVM</p>
<p>5. Enrico Cassani (Italy) Polti</p>
<p>6. Lars Michaelsen (Denmark) TVM</p>
<p>7. Henk Vogels (Australia) Gan</p>
<p>8. Massimo Strazzer (Italy) Roslotto</p>
<p>9. Marco Bellini (Italy) Asics</p>
<p> 10.Alvaro Gonzalez (Spain) Euskadi   all same time</p>
<p>Leading overall standings after two stages:</p>
<p> 1. Chris Boardman (Britain) Gan   6 hours 7 minutes 6 seconds</p>
<p>2. Angel Luis Casero (Spain) Banesto  12 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Aitor Garmendia (Spain) ONCE	     same time</p>
<p> 4. Fernando Escartin (Spain) Kelme	  23</p>
<p> 5. Stuart O'Grady (Australi) Gan	    32</p>
<p>6. Armand de las Cuevas (France) Banesto  33</p>
<p>7. Alberto Leanizbarrutia (Spain) Banesto  </p>
<p> 8. Alvaro Gonzalez (Spain) Euskadi	   </p>
<p> 9. Alonso Marino (Spain) Banesto	    all same time</p>
<p> 10.Bart Voskamp (Netherlands) TVM	   36</p>
